在空数据库中执行下列 SQL，最后 SELECT 返回的唯一数值是 ____。

```sql
CREATE TABLE team_demo(team VARCHAR(4), score INT);
INSERT INTO team_demo VALUES ('A',6),('A',4),('B',8),('B',NULL),('C',3);
SELECT SUM(s) FROM (
    SELECT team, SUM(score) AS s
    FROM team_demo GROUP BY team HAVING COUNT(score) >= 2
) AS eligible;
```

